]}\n```\n\n\n', 'output': 'Evaluation: I am holding a single Ace (♣A). The previous player (Left) played a single Ace (♦A). In Fight the Landlord, to beat a single card, I must play a higher ranked single card (2, Black Joker, or Red Joker) or a Bomb/Rocket. Since my only card is equal in rank to the previous play, I cannot beat it. The system also confirms there are no valid moves available.\n\nReason: I cannot beat a single Ace with my own single Ace. I must pass.\n\nAnswer: {"cards": []}'}
